SUMMARY:Traveler Mindset: Understanding Past and Future Lives
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nTrave
 ler Mindset: Understanding Past and Future Lives with Modern Buddhism Teac
 her Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\nThe long-term perspective espoused by Buddhist 
 thought is clarifying and freeing. We stop sweating the small stuff as we 
 base our thinking on the vast time horizon of countless past and future li
 ves. This view helps us understand our idiosyncrasies and confusions\, ill
 uminating the path forward. Specifically\, focus on what matters—creatin
 g good intentions\, loving people more\, and making a positive difference 
 in the world.\nCome learn the ins and outs of rebirth\, the formless conti
 nuum of our mind and what it all means for the ‘here and now’ of our p
 resent life.\nIncludes guided meditations\, time for Q&A\, and refreshment
 s\nCost: $30 (discounts and online options for members)\n[Read More and Re
 gister](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/traveler-mindset-understandi
 ng-past-and-future-lives/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinashe
 ville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31595989
 0/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260803T133023Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260803T133023Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
