SUMMARY:The Science of Happiness: The Four Noble Truths
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nThe S
 cience of Happiness: The Four Noble Truths with Modern Buddhism Teacher Ka
 dam Sharon Lovich\n\n**Sundays 8/16-9/13\, 10:30am-11:45am**\nWhether it
 ’s everyday stress\, sadness\, or even anger\, our suffering can be tran
 sformed into inner strength\, love\, and joy. The first step is understand
 ing its source. In this series\, we’ll explore Buddha’s teachings on t
 he Four Noble Truths. The Four Noble Truths are the essence of Buddhist th
 ought and gives us a clear\, precise way to understand our life and how to
  move forward in it. Through teachings and meditation\, we’ll discover t
 hat suffering comes not from external conditions\, but from our own mind. 
 Recognizing this opens the door to transforming our experience and uncover
 ing a more lasting\, genuine happiness.\nCost: $12 (free and online option
 s for members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditationinasheville
 .org/sunday-drop-in-meditation-class/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.medi
 tationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31596104
 4/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260803T144333Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260803T144333Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
