SUMMARY:A Foundation for Happiness: Taming the Wild Elephant Mind
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nA Fou
 ndation for Happiness: Taming the Wild Elephant Mind with Modern Buddhism 
 Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\n**Wednesdays 8/19-9/2 7pm-8pm**\nBuilding a
  foundation for happiness begins with considering the quality of our actio
 ns of body\, speech and mind\, In this series we will explore some time te
 sted wisdom from Buddhist psychology that will help us to live with more i
 ntegrity as we learn to gain control over our ‘wild elephant mind’\nCo
 st: $12 (free and online options for members)\n[Read More and Register](ht
 tps://www.meditationinasheville.org/wednesday-drop-in-meditation-class-ash
 eville-nc/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/becom
 e-a-member/)
